# Stationary camera-orbit regression for Skybridge 3D.
# Keep the avatar at its spawn point: only rotate the camera by six B taps
# (90 degrees). The pilot must stay on the initial deck in BOTH views;
# its projected position changes naturally, but its world coords do not.
# Toggle Y debug HUD at frame 70; DECK must stay 1 before and after six taps.
0    NONE
70   Y
71   NONE
90   B
91   NONE
94   B
95   NONE
98   B
99   NONE
102  B
103  NONE
106  B
107  NONE
110  B
111  NONE
